abstract: >-
  A comprehensive, institutional-grade research dossier evaluating the post-merger
  consolidation of PT Pelabuhan Indonesia (Persero) (Pelindo), end-to-end container
  terminal operations at the Port of Tanjung Priok, digital systems integration,
  regional benchmarking across Southeast Asia, ESG decarbonization pathways, and systemic
  governance and risk frameworks.
